WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:38.380
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:38.650 --> 01:43.039
[Shadow Punisher]

3
01:43.090 --> 01:43.720
[Divine Constable Tally]

4
01:43.720 --> 01:45.870
[Episode 13]

5
01:46.759 --> 01:48.200
Don't run! Stop!

6
01:49.640 --> 01:50.509
Got you now!

7
01:53.759 --> 01:54.560
Get her!

8
01:59.229 --> 02:00.040
Stop!

9
02:01.710 --> 02:02.510
My Lords.

10
02:02.510 --> 02:03.710
This girl ran away from the mansion.

11
02:03.710 --> 02:04.710
We are teaching her a lesson

12
02:04.710 --> 02:05.640
on behalf of our Master.

13
02:05.640 --> 02:06.700
We won't bother...

14
02:07.840 --> 02:09.000
So many of you

15
02:09.520 --> 02:10.960
beating a child.

16
02:11.000 --> 02:12.310
Have you no shame?

17
02:18.310 --> 02:19.120
Jiuying.

18
02:19.960 --> 02:20.910
Don't be afraid.

19
02:21.520 --> 02:22.960
I won't hurt you.

20
02:25.000 --> 02:26.190
If you want,

21
02:26.190 --> 02:27.560
come back with us.

22
02:37.240 --> 02:38.030
Watch out.

23
02:54.310 --> 02:55.120
There it is!

24
02:59.710 --> 03:00.460
Run!

25
03:00.480 --> 03:01.710
Oh my goodness.

26
03:01.840 --> 03:03.750
This must be the real green-haired demon.

27
03:03.750 --> 03:06.150
There really is a demon in Mingling County.

28
03:12.240 --> 03:13.030
After them!

29
03:28.000 --> 03:29.710
If what the note says is true

30
03:30.030 --> 03:31.840
and Gong Sihai is selling government salt,

31
03:31.840 --> 03:33.630
I'm afraid the waters in Mingling County

32
03:33.630 --> 03:35.430
are much deeper than we thought.

33
04:04.240 --> 04:05.030
This is...

34
04:06.960 --> 04:07.900
A Chiying bug.

35
04:45.159 --> 04:47.510
I've searched high and low for this.

36
04:48.310 --> 04:49.000
I didn't expect

37
04:49.000 --> 04:50.560
to find it here.

38
04:52.630 --> 04:54.360
No wonder it's called Chiying.

39
04:54.830 --> 04:55.630
It must be

40
04:56.190 --> 04:57.190
named after

41
04:57.190 --> 04:58.600
its glowing wings.

42
05:00.600 --> 05:02.040
This tiny bug

43
05:02.600 --> 05:04.860
can actually mutate people into demons.

44
05:05.160 --> 05:06.360
Could the Gong family

45
05:06.800 --> 05:09.000
also be related to the Liluo Dark Night?

46
05:09.040 --> 05:10.360
Old Geezer said that

47
05:10.630 --> 05:11.750
these Chiying bugs

48
05:12.000 --> 05:14.600
love to gather around graves.

49
05:16.160 --> 05:17.890
Could it be that in this lake...

50
05:18.040 --> 05:19.500
Let's go down and find out.

51
05:27.720 --> 05:29.650
It's Zhenzhu, Yan, and the others.

52
05:31.040 --> 05:32.440
Let's go help them first.

53
05:32.560 --> 05:33.830
Anyway, a lake this big

54
05:34.040 --> 05:35.440
won't run away on its own.

55
05:46.720 --> 05:47.510
Yan.

56
05:48.830 --> 05:49.720
What happened?

57
05:49.720 --> 05:50.600
Let me tell you.

58
05:50.950 --> 05:52.750
My eyes were really opened today.

59
05:52.750 --> 05:54.040
There really is a green-haired demon.

60
05:54.040 --> 05:55.950
It was covered in green hair.

61
05:56.159 --> 05:57.430
It looked like a wolf,

62
05:57.430 --> 05:58.200
but for some reason,

63
05:58.200 --> 05:58.920
it became demonic.

64
05:58.920 --> 05:59.560
What?

65
05:59.560 --> 06:00.830
Yan isn't exaggerating.

66
06:00.830 --> 06:01.690
We originally wanted

67
06:01.690 --> 06:02.630
to save Xia Jiuying,

68
06:02.630 --> 06:03.790
but a wolf appeared all of a sudden

69
06:03.790 --> 06:04.990
and carried her away.

70
06:05.120 --> 06:06.040
Although it's a wolf,

71
06:06.040 --> 06:07.720
its body has completely mutated.

72
06:07.720 --> 06:09.390
It doesn't look like a normal animal at all.

73
06:09.390 --> 06:10.790
Where is the mutated wolf

74
06:11.630 --> 06:12.510
now?

75
06:13.310 --> 06:14.120
How can two legs

76
06:14.120 --> 06:15.430
outrun four paws?

77
06:15.430 --> 06:16.630
We couldn't catch up.

78
06:17.120 --> 06:18.310
It also snatched

79
06:18.310 --> 06:19.510
Huang Bingshui away.

80
06:19.830 --> 06:20.630
Speak.

81
06:21.120 --> 06:21.920
I'll speak!

82
06:22.630 --> 06:23.310
We were

83
06:23.310 --> 06:24.630
running ahead.

84
06:24.630 --> 06:26.040
Then we heard a scream

85
06:26.040 --> 06:27.380
and saw Huang Bingshui

86
06:27.400 --> 06:28.950
being carried away by that demon wolf.

87
06:28.950 --> 06:29.750
Was he eaten?

88
06:30.160 --> 06:31.430
We didn't dare to look.

89
06:32.390 --> 06:33.340
Only drip-shaped bloodstains

90
06:33.340 --> 06:34.670
were found at the scene.

91
06:34.720 --> 06:35.630
Judging from this,

92
06:35.630 --> 06:36.740
he must have been bitten

93
06:36.740 --> 06:37.430
and taken away.

94
06:37.430 --> 06:38.190
Strange.

95
06:39.130 --> 06:41.000
Why did it take Huang Bingshui away?

96
06:41.000 --> 06:41.800
It must be...

97
06:41.950 --> 06:43.190
It must be Xia Jiuying

98
06:43.190 --> 06:44.570
who made that monster do it.

99
06:44.570 --> 06:45.800
Huang Bingshui

100
06:45.820 --> 06:47.060
often beat that girl.

101
06:47.240 --> 06:48.159
Tell me,

102
06:48.720 --> 06:49.540
how did Zhe Shan

103
06:49.540 --> 06:50.700
treat Xia Jiuying?

104
06:50.790 --> 06:53.159
He always beat and scolded her.

105
06:57.630 --> 06:58.430
Zhenzhu,

106
06:58.830 --> 06:59.890
do you suspect that

107
07:00.430 --> 07:02.310
Xia Jiuying ordered the demon wolf

108
07:02.310 --> 07:03.710
to maul Zhe Shan to death?

109
07:05.950 --> 07:06.830
I think

110
07:07.040 --> 07:08.390
it's really possible.

111
07:09.040 --> 07:11.800
A green-haired demon appeared in Mingling County.

112
07:11.800 --> 07:13.360
Under Xia Jiuying's orders,

113
07:13.360 --> 07:15.390
it mauled the boxer Zhe Shan to death,

114
07:15.390 --> 07:16.430
carried the body

115
07:16.430 --> 07:17.800
into Mount Fuyao,

116
07:17.830 --> 07:19.490
and dumped it in the Yan River.

117
07:19.800 --> 07:20.720
It all adds up.

118
07:24.510 --> 07:25.310
Anyway,

119
07:26.000 --> 07:27.280
let's find him first.

120
07:27.300 --> 07:28.190
Are they leaving us here?

121
07:28.190 --> 07:29.520
Mount Fuyao is this way.

122
07:32.870 --> 07:33.560
My Lords!

123
07:33.560 --> 07:33.920
My Lords!

124
07:33.920 --> 07:35.620
-My Lords, please let us go. -My Lord, please let me down!

125
07:35.620 --> 07:36.820
-My Lords! -My Lords!

126
07:50.560 --> 07:51.360
My Lord,

127
07:51.360 --> 07:52.510
we found nothing.

128
07:58.310 --> 07:59.240
My Lords,

129
08:00.600 --> 08:02.000
Mount Fuyao is huge.

130
08:02.630 --> 08:04.430
We've been searching all night.

131
08:04.720 --> 08:06.720
Are you sure it's in this direction?

132
08:08.800 --> 08:10.950
Huang Bingshui was injured last night.

133
08:10.950 --> 08:12.360
The wound should have clotted by now.

134
08:12.360 --> 08:14.920
Would there still be bloodstains on the ground?

135
08:14.920 --> 08:16.040
Blood can clot,

136
08:16.390 --> 08:17.560
but the smell won't.

137
08:24.160 --> 08:25.720
Found him! Found him!

138
08:31.190 --> 08:32.929
Found him! He's here!

139
08:33.440 --> 08:34.600
Help!

140
08:34.870 --> 08:35.360
Here!

141
08:35.360 --> 08:36.440
Help!

142
08:38.150 --> 08:39.600
My Lord! My Lord!

143
08:39.600 --> 08:40.390
Save me...

144
08:40.840 --> 08:41.630
Save me!

145
08:43.150 --> 08:44.030
Save me...

146
08:45.030 --> 08:45.790
This bite mark

147
08:45.790 --> 08:47.050
matches the one on Zhe Shan's throat

148
08:47.050 --> 08:47.860
perfectly.

149
08:48.120 --> 08:49.150
What did I tell you?

150
08:49.150 --> 08:50.650
It must be that girl seeking revenge

151
08:50.650 --> 08:51.600
by setting the wolf on him.

152
08:51.600 --> 08:52.390
No.

153
08:52.790 --> 08:54.440
If it was for revenge,

154
08:54.440 --> 08:55.960
why didn't he die instantly

155
08:55.960 --> 08:57.030
with a crushed throat like Zhe Shan?

156
08:57.030 --> 08:57.960
My Lord, save me.

157
08:58.150 --> 08:59.030
Just save me,

158
08:59.360 --> 09:00.790
and I'll tell you everything.

159
09:00.790 --> 09:01.840
Ji Ada did it all.

160
09:01.840 --> 09:03.030
Ji Ada did it all!

161
09:03.030 --> 09:04.320
I was forced into it!

162
09:05.720 --> 09:06.840
Stop dawdling.

163
09:07.120 --> 09:07.910
Spit it out.

164
09:08.200 --> 09:09.840
I'll tell you everything.

165
09:10.750 --> 09:11.750
Twelve years ago,

166
09:12.600 --> 09:14.120
Ji Ada took a few of us

167
09:14.600 --> 09:16.400
up the mountains to hunt wolves.

168
09:17.790 --> 09:19.650
We ran into Xia Jiuying's mother.

169
09:21.000 --> 09:23.000
Seeing that she was somewhat pretty,

170
09:23.000 --> 09:24.510
he harbored lecherous thoughts.

171
09:24.510 --> 09:26.320
But she resisted aggressively

172
09:27.200 --> 09:28.720
and even bit Ji Ada.

173
09:29.000 --> 09:30.030
In a fit of anger,

174
09:30.750 --> 09:32.240
he ordered me to release the dogs.

175
09:32.240 --> 09:33.720
Those were hunting dogs.

176
09:34.120 --> 09:35.360
They were very fierce.

177
09:35.360 --> 09:37.240
About 4 or 5 of them surrounded the woman

178
09:37.240 --> 09:38.600
and bit her to death.

179
09:38.600 --> 09:39.270
What?

180
09:40.240 --> 09:41.440
So Xia Jiuying's mother

181
09:41.440 --> 09:42.840
wasn't killed by wolves.

182
09:42.880 --> 09:44.030
She was killed by you

183
09:44.030 --> 09:44.600
animals!

184
09:44.600 --> 09:45.790
No, it wasn't me!

185
09:45.790 --> 09:46.510
Divine Constable,

186
09:46.510 --> 09:48.000
Ji Ada made me do it.

187
09:48.000 --> 09:49.240
I had no choice.

188
09:55.120 --> 09:56.050
Does Xia Jiuying

189
09:56.630 --> 09:58.030
know about this?

190
09:59.120 --> 09:59.910
No.

191
10:01.120 --> 10:02.320
Once out of the woods,

192
10:02.840 --> 10:04.570
no one ever mentioned it again.

193
10:04.630 --> 10:05.830
Ji Ada put out the word

194
10:06.120 --> 10:06.960
that the woman

195
10:07.790 --> 10:09.120
was mauled by wolves.

196
10:09.750 --> 10:11.120
If anyone let it slip,

197
10:12.030 --> 10:13.490
he'd cut their tongue out.

198
10:13.550 --> 10:14.840
But Ji Ada said

199
10:15.440 --> 10:16.840
he was the one who collected

200
10:16.840 --> 10:17.840
her mother's body.

201
10:17.840 --> 10:18.720
Bah!

202
10:20.200 --> 10:21.320
Killing someone

203
10:21.510 --> 10:23.040
and burying them on the spot

204
10:23.390 --> 10:25.150
is hardly considered collecting a body.

205
10:25.150 --> 10:25.840
I still remember

206
10:25.840 --> 10:27.040
where she was buried.

207
10:27.840 --> 10:29.700
It's just a little further ahead.

208
10:30.840 --> 10:32.000
I can take you there.

209
10:32.430 --> 10:33.440
But now,

210
10:34.000 --> 10:35.600
there's nothing left there.

211
10:35.750 --> 10:36.630
I've already given

212
10:36.630 --> 10:37.910
the last skull

213
10:38.440 --> 10:39.720
to Xia Jiuying.

214
10:40.720 --> 10:42.360
She kept you alive

215
10:43.200 --> 10:44.840
just so you could point out

216
10:44.840 --> 10:46.030
the burial spot?

217
10:47.630 --> 10:48.440
Yes.

218
10:51.630 --> 10:52.960
Xia Jiuying has been looking for her mother

219
10:52.960 --> 10:53.960
for so many years.

220
10:54.000 --> 10:54.890
Didn't she

221
10:54.920 --> 10:56.200
ask you before?

222
10:56.440 --> 10:57.790
Of course she did.

223
10:58.510 --> 10:59.510
But who would

224
11:00.320 --> 11:01.320
dare to tell her?

225
11:02.000 --> 11:03.630
Later, Xia Jiuying grew up

226
11:03.910 --> 11:04.750
to be foolish

227
11:04.750 --> 11:06.080
but skilled at hunting.

228
11:06.750 --> 11:08.550
So Ji Ada took an interest in her.

229
11:08.720 --> 11:09.600
Ji Ada

230
11:10.240 --> 11:11.000
came up with a

231
11:11.000 --> 11:12.320
wicked idea to use the dead

232
11:12.320 --> 11:13.580
to control the living.

233
11:13.600 --> 11:14.800
Every once in a while,

234
11:15.320 --> 11:17.450
he would dig up a bone and toss it to her.

235
11:18.200 --> 11:18.920
To get

236
11:18.950 --> 11:20.390
her mother's bones,

237
11:21.510 --> 11:23.240
Xia Jiuying had to work for him.

238
11:23.440 --> 11:24.550
After 5 years,

239
11:25.200 --> 11:26.390
the whole skeleton

240
11:27.200 --> 11:29.000
is now only missing a skull.

241
11:29.000 --> 11:30.200
A bunch of animals!

242
11:31.200 --> 11:32.150
Now tell me.

243
11:32.670 --> 11:33.540
When the dogs were released

244
11:33.540 --> 11:35.670
to maul Xia Jiuying's mother to death,

245
11:35.720 --> 11:36.790
was Zhe Shan there?

246
11:37.480 --> 11:38.270
Yes.

247
11:38.630 --> 11:40.360
Yes, he was there too!

248
11:40.750 --> 11:42.510
He was leading one of the dogs.

249
11:42.840 --> 11:44.390
You used the bones of a loved one

250
11:44.390 --> 11:46.000
to threaten a child!

251
11:46.440 --> 11:47.670
You're all worse than animals!

252
11:47.670 --> 11:48.480
My Lords,

253
11:49.240 --> 11:50.720
please have mercy!

254
11:50.960 --> 11:52.120
Please have mercy.

255
11:53.000 --> 11:55.200
For the sake of me helping Xia Jiuying

256
11:55.390 --> 11:56.550
find her mother,

257
11:56.840 --> 11:57.910
please spare me.

258
11:58.200 --> 11:59.150
Just now,

259
12:00.000 --> 12:01.440
I dug up that skull

260
12:01.720 --> 12:03.150
and gave it to her.

261
12:03.910 --> 12:05.200
Please spare me.

262
12:05.630 --> 12:07.240
Let me go, My Lord.

263
12:07.440 --> 12:09.000
My Lord, My Lord.

264
12:09.000 --> 12:10.030
My Lord, My Lord.

265
12:12.390 --> 12:13.320
Please spare me.

266
12:14.030 --> 12:15.690
My Lords, you don't know this,

267
12:15.840 --> 12:16.840
but that Hound Pit

268
12:17.840 --> 12:19.040
hides other secrets.

269
12:20.360 --> 12:21.750
If you spare me,

270
12:22.630 --> 12:24.320
I will confess everything.

271
12:25.150 --> 12:26.720
I will confess everything!

272
12:27.550 --> 12:28.950
My Lord, please spare me.

273
12:29.030 --> 12:29.960
Please spare me!

274
12:36.110 --> 12:37.060
Lord Situ.

275
12:38.960 --> 12:40.000
Please

276
12:40.750 --> 12:42.680
escort this man back to the county office

277
12:42.680 --> 12:44.000
for overnight interrogation.

278
12:44.000 --> 12:45.000
Leave the rest

279
12:45.510 --> 12:46.550
to us.

280
12:46.840 --> 12:47.630
Yes.

281
12:48.150 --> 12:48.840
Take him away.

282
12:48.840 --> 12:49.640
Take him away.

283
12:50.600 --> 12:51.660
Please spare me...

284
12:52.720 --> 12:53.510
My Lord!

285
12:54.360 --> 12:55.150
Move!

286
12:56.840 --> 12:57.960
I didn't expect

287
12:58.440 --> 13:00.840
this child to have such a hard life.

288
13:03.840 --> 13:05.000
If Xia Jiuying

289
13:05.000 --> 13:06.930
really ordered the wolves to kill,

290
13:07.150 --> 13:08.440
even if she is pitiful,

291
13:09.200 --> 13:10.800
the law will not tolerate it.

292
14:47.150 --> 14:47.960
Xia Jiuying.

293
14:53.910 --> 14:54.720
Go away!

294
14:55.030 --> 14:56.600
I want to be with my mother.

295
14:58.000 --> 15:00.200
Mother, I will protect you.

296
15:00.840 --> 15:02.390
That should be her mother.

297
15:06.360 --> 15:07.150
Xia Jiuying,

298
15:08.030 --> 15:09.410
listen to me.

299
15:10.240 --> 15:11.790
We won't hurt you,

300
15:12.150 --> 15:13.750
nor will we hurt your mother.

301
15:14.390 --> 15:15.720
We are here to help you.

302
15:16.270 --> 15:17.080
Liars!

303
15:17.630 --> 15:18.440
Liars...

304
15:19.360 --> 15:20.840
You are all liars!

305
15:21.840 --> 15:22.630
Lying to me,

306
15:23.200 --> 15:24.960
you are all lying to me!

307
15:25.440 --> 15:26.700
We are not lying to you.

308
15:27.750 --> 15:28.720
Trust me.

309
15:29.000 --> 15:30.910
As long as you tell us the truth,

310
15:30.960 --> 15:33.220
we will definitely find a way to help you.

311
15:36.390 --> 15:37.360
Tell me.

312
15:38.120 --> 15:39.120
Was it you

313
15:39.720 --> 15:41.850
who controlled your demon wolf friend

314
15:42.000 --> 15:43.400
to maul Zhe Shan to death?

315
15:45.320 --> 15:47.740
They all deserve to die!

316
16:00.630 --> 16:01.910
They

317
16:03.840 --> 16:05.530
killed my mother...

318
16:08.910 --> 16:12.510
This was stuck in my mother's bones.

319
16:14.440 --> 16:15.790
I recognize it.

320
16:19.200 --> 16:20.780
It's a dog fang.

321
16:21.000 --> 16:22.730
It's a dog fang!

322
16:23.390 --> 16:26.420
It wasn't a wolf that bit my mother to death.

323
16:26.600 --> 16:28.090
It was a dog,

324
16:30.720 --> 16:32.870
and the person holding the leash!

325
16:35.720 --> 16:38.030
It was Ji Ada,

326
16:40.440 --> 16:42.200
Huang Mazi,

327
16:44.320 --> 16:45.600
and Zhe Shan!

328
16:45.630 --> 16:47.350
They all deserve to die!

329
16:47.630 --> 16:48.560
They deserve it!

330
16:48.790 --> 16:50.760
They all deserve to die.

331
16:51.200 --> 16:52.300
They deserve it!

332
16:52.550 --> 16:53.830
They deserve it!

333
16:53.960 --> 16:55.020
They deserve it...

334
16:55.200 --> 16:57.330
They all deserve to die!

335
16:59.200 --> 17:00.150
They deserve it.

336
17:02.320 --> 17:03.750
They all deserve to die.

337
17:03.750 --> 17:05.319
They deserve it! They deserve it!

338
17:05.319 --> 17:06.800
They all deserve to die!

339
17:34.110 --> 17:35.550
I'm begging you!

340
17:35.550 --> 17:37.160
I'm begging you!

341
17:37.960 --> 17:39.400
Don't take me away.

342
17:39.400 --> 17:41.200
I'm begging you...

343
17:43.110 --> 17:45.350
I want to stay with her a little longer.

344
17:46.750 --> 17:48.740
I want revenge.

345
17:55.110 --> 17:56.200
I also want

346
17:57.310 --> 17:59.110
to live.

347
18:12.830 --> 18:14.230
It is indeed a dog's fang.

348
18:18.750 --> 18:19.550
So,

349
18:20.720 --> 18:21.960
she knew everything.

350
18:27.200 --> 18:27.380
She has been away

351
18:27.380 --> 18:30.310
♪ A solitary boat dividing left and right ♪

352
18:30.310 --> 18:32.720
from home for too long.

353
18:34.690 --> 18:35.200
♪ Amidst the vast, misty waters, they sail toward the surging tide ♪

354
18:35.200 --> 18:37.160
I'm begging you...

355
18:42.160 --> 18:42.410
Please...

356
18:42.410 --> 18:47.950
♪ The rust of old memories feels like a waking dream ♪

357
18:49.550 --> 18:50.010
Mother.

358
18:50.010 --> 18:51.830
♪It hurts to let go, but I'm holding tightly to emptiness♪

359
18:51.830 --> 18:53.440
I will protect you.

360
18:54.350 --> 18:57.370
I won't let anyone

361
18:57.370 --> 18:59.310
♪ Should we meet across mountains and seas ♪

362
18:59.310 --> 19:01.160
separate us.

363
19:01.530 --> 19:04.260
♪ If the long road leads to no return ♪

364
19:04.980 --> 19:09.440
♪ If I can't travel with you in this life ♪

365
19:09.440 --> 19:12.480
The stars in the sky

366
19:13.040 --> 19:14.070
♪ If the lights in my heart ♪

367
19:14.070 --> 19:16.640
are blinking.

368
19:16.970 --> 19:18.240
♪ Become old marks with the falling snow ♪

369
19:18.240 --> 19:20.650
Where will mother stop on her journey?

370
19:20.650 --> 19:26.350
♪ I'll reminisce with you in the next life ♪

371
19:26.350 --> 19:27.560
Every star

372
19:27.560 --> 19:29.720
♪ Your hesitant steps back then ♪

373
19:29.720 --> 19:31.880
is a light,

374
19:32.320 --> 19:33.720
♪ If the years flow by like river waters, how can they be held back? ♪

375
19:33.720 --> 19:40.110
guiding mother safely through the night.

376
19:40.110 --> 19:42.990
♪ Should we meet across mountains and seas ♪

377
19:44.070 --> 19:46.670
♪ If the long road leads to no return ♪

378
19:47.700 --> 19:52.110
♪ If I can't travel with you in this life ♪

379
19:52.110 --> 19:53.000
What a sin.

380
19:54.440 --> 19:55.510
Arrest her if you want.

381
19:55.510 --> 19:56.440
♪ If the lights in my heart ♪

382
19:56.440 --> 19:58.040
I can't bring myself to do it.

383
19:59.480 --> 20:02.720
♪ Become old marks with the falling snow ♪

384
20:03.480 --> 20:04.270
Xia Jiuying.

385
20:05.920 --> 20:07.050
I understand your difficulties.

386
20:07.050 --> 20:07.510
♪ I'll reminisce with you in the next life ♪

387
20:07.510 --> 20:09.550
But the state has its laws, and the family has its rules.

388
20:09.550 --> 20:11.240
You let the wolf kill Zhe Shan.

389
20:11.240 --> 20:13.700
You must return to the county office with us.

390
20:25.440 --> 20:26.980
My colleagues,

391
20:27.440 --> 20:28.830
I hope you've been well.

392
20:33.200 --> 20:34.200
Lou Tianming?

393
20:35.000 --> 20:35.920
They are here.

394
20:36.160 --> 20:37.200
They are here!

395
20:42.440 --> 20:43.240
Everyone,

396
20:44.000 --> 20:45.400
we're taking Xia Jiuying

397
20:45.640 --> 20:47.040
and breaking out of here.

398
21:02.550 --> 21:03.830
It really is you,

399
21:04.550 --> 21:05.720
Lou Tianming!

400
21:34.110 --> 21:35.200
Yan Zige?

401
21:35.920 --> 21:36.920
You're alive?

402
21:37.350 --> 21:37.590
[Demonic Overlord, Yan Zisheng]

403
21:37.590 --> 21:40.920
My brother died at the hands of the Divine Constable Bureau.

404
21:41.110 --> 21:42.480
Today, I

405
21:42.640 --> 21:44.640
will avenge him!

406
21:44.670 --> 21:45.830
Don't kill Big Wolf.

407
21:45.890 --> 21:47.030
Don't kill Big Wolf!

408
21:47.030 --> 21:48.070
Don't kill Big Wolf!

409
21:48.070 --> 21:50.400
-During my absence, -Don’t kill Big Wolf!

410
21:50.510 --> 21:51.620
has the Bureau been well?

411
21:51.620 --> 21:52.930
How dare you ask?

412
21:53.310 --> 21:55.040
I used to treat you as a brother.

413
21:56.070 --> 21:58.030
I, Yan Sanhuo, was blind

414
21:58.270 --> 22:00.070
not to see your cruel nature!

415
22:00.280 --> 22:01.040
Lou.

416
22:01.720 --> 22:03.110
It's been over a month since we parted.

417
22:03.110 --> 22:04.790
I've missed you very much.

418
22:05.070 --> 22:06.930
Since you went to work elsewhere,

419
22:06.960 --> 22:08.270
why didn't you say goodbye

420
22:08.270 --> 22:09.460
