421
22:09.830 --> 22:10.830
Lord Li,

422
22:11.310 --> 22:13.510
you've been promoted to Divine Constable.

423
22:13.510 --> 22:14.680
I must

424
22:14.880 --> 22:16.780
congratulate you.

425
22:17.510 --> 22:19.110
The Divine Constable Bureau

426
22:19.110 --> 22:20.640
only has four Divine Constables.

427
22:20.640 --> 22:22.430
Four spots for 4 people.

428
22:22.480 --> 22:24.250
If you didn't leave, Lou,

429
22:24.440 --> 22:25.880
how would there be a place for me?

430
22:25.880 --> 22:26.840
Qingyang,

431
22:28.160 --> 22:29.310
your sharp tongue

432
22:30.060 --> 22:32.390
is wasted at the Divine Constable Bureau.

433
22:32.750 --> 22:34.240
Why don't you come with me?

434
22:34.400 --> 22:35.430
Lou,

435
22:36.240 --> 22:38.170
you're on a bad luck streak lately.

436
22:38.310 --> 22:39.240
If I follow you,

437
22:39.920 --> 22:41.090
I'd surely lose.

438
22:41.440 --> 22:43.100
Your brother's revenge

439
22:43.920 --> 22:45.660
can be taken today!

440
22:50.960 --> 22:52.420
Zhenzhu, you protect her.

441
22:52.960 --> 22:54.300
I haven't had a good fight

442
22:54.300 --> 22:55.640
in a long time.

443
22:55.760 --> 22:56.560
Kill!

444
22:56.800 --> 22:57.840
Kill!

445
24:34.440 --> 24:34.960
Yan!

446
24:44.310 --> 24:46.040
How did you become such a freak?

447
24:47.510 --> 24:48.380
Watch out!

448
25:16.790 --> 25:17.510
Big Wolf!

449
25:18.310 --> 25:19.590
-Jiuying. -Big Wolf!

450
25:28.350 --> 25:30.410
What a splendid demonized creature!

451
25:30.750 --> 25:32.200
Such a pity.

452
25:35.240 --> 25:37.450
Anyone who opposes Liluo

453
25:38.310 --> 25:40.180
is asking for death.

454
25:41.640 --> 25:43.500
No, Big Wolf!

455
25:44.110 --> 25:45.640
No!

456
25:47.830 --> 25:49.720
No, Big Wolf!

457
25:51.240 --> 25:52.160
Big Wolf!

458
25:57.350 --> 25:58.470
Big Wolf!

459
25:58.750 --> 26:00.450
-Big Wolf! -Jiuying!

460
26:00.650 --> 26:02.570
Big Wolf!

461
26:03.000 --> 26:05.160
Big Wolf...

462
26:11.350 --> 26:12.400
Big Wolf!

463
26:12.750 --> 26:13.640
Big Wolf!

464
26:14.510 --> 26:15.640
Big Wolf...

465
26:16.630 --> 26:17.430
No...

466
26:18.720 --> 26:21.160
No, don't die, Big Wolf!

467
26:23.550 --> 26:25.480
Don't die, Big Wolf!

468
26:27.270 --> 26:28.070
No!

469
26:29.690 --> 26:30.450
No...

470
26:30.980 --> 26:31.770
No...

471
26:31.790 --> 26:33.760
Don't die, Big Wolf!

472
26:33.790 --> 26:36.440
Big Wolf! Big Wolf!

473
26:37.240 --> 26:38.590
Big Wolf!

474
26:39.200 --> 26:40.400
No!

475
26:41.640 --> 26:43.310
Don't die, Big Wolf!

476
26:43.310 --> 26:44.640
No! No!

477
27:33.070 --> 27:34.330
Lou Tianming escaped,

478
27:34.680 --> 27:36.010
but he's badly injured.

479
27:36.030 --> 27:37.490
Knowing his temperament,

480
27:37.550 --> 27:38.790
he likely won't make any rash moves

481
27:38.790 --> 27:40.300
in the near future.

482
28:03.110 --> 28:03.960
Xia Jiuying.

483
28:05.490 --> 28:06.650
You knew all along

484
28:07.880 --> 28:09.270
they would come after us,

485
28:09.270 --> 28:10.070
didn't you?

486
28:13.310 --> 28:14.350
Tell me,

487
28:14.960 --> 28:16.290
why did those demon-men

488
28:17.150 --> 28:18.500
want to kill you?

489
28:19.510 --> 28:20.310
Because...

490
28:23.880 --> 28:25.270
T-They caught Big Wolf

491
28:27.270 --> 28:29.400
and took it

492
28:33.160 --> 28:35.720
to a glowing cave.

493
28:38.680 --> 28:40.110
There were bugs.

494
28:40.310 --> 28:41.640
A glowing cave?

495
28:42.350 --> 28:43.200
Bugs?

496
28:44.720 --> 28:45.680
Where is the cave?

497
28:45.680 --> 28:46.990
Do you remember?

498
28:48.480 --> 28:49.270
Xia Jiuying.

499
28:49.350 --> 28:50.960
-Go away! Go away! -Tell me!

500
28:50.960 --> 28:52.090
-Go away! -Meng Rui.

501
28:56.960 --> 28:58.690
-She's in shock now. -Big Wolf.

502
28:58.720 --> 29:00.160
-I’m afraid she won't be -Big Wolf.

503
29:00.160 --> 29:01.490
speaking up for a while.

504
29:01.730 --> 29:02.930
-But... -Big Wolf...

505
29:03.110 --> 29:04.190
I believe

506
29:04.590 --> 29:06.720
she must know the location of the cave.

507
29:06.750 --> 29:07.550
Otherwise,

508
29:07.750 --> 29:09.550
Lou Tianming wouldn't have chased her all the way here

509
29:09.550 --> 29:10.550
to silence her.

510
29:13.750 --> 29:15.200
Give her some time.

511
29:16.550 --> 29:18.030
Big Wolf...

512
29:20.310 --> 29:21.110
For now,

513
29:21.960 --> 29:22.990
we should first

514
29:23.020 --> 29:24.950
close the case in Mingling County.

515
29:29.070 --> 29:30.330
Isn't the case solved?

516
29:30.590 --> 29:32.390
The green-haired demon is dead.

517
29:32.510 --> 29:34.720
The real culprit of the floating corpse case is here.

518
29:34.720 --> 29:35.850
Isn't it all solved?

519
29:36.750 --> 29:37.680
Brother Sanhuo.

520
29:38.550 --> 29:40.270
A so-called shocking case

521
29:40.590 --> 29:42.400
is not that easy to solve.

522
29:42.620 --> 29:45.170
[Mingling County Government]

523
29:57.690 --> 29:58.490
Officers.

524
29:59.440 --> 30:00.240
Officers.

525
30:00.270 --> 30:02.060
No need to trouble yourselves.

526
30:02.080 --> 30:02.880
I'll confess.

527
30:03.010 --> 30:04.470
I'll confess everything!

528
30:05.590 --> 30:06.400
Move.

529
30:14.030 --> 30:14.830
Move.

530
30:15.750 --> 30:16.550
Hurry up.

531
30:18.480 --> 30:19.340
Lord Situ.

532
30:19.370 --> 30:20.020
Move.

533
30:20.350 --> 30:21.160
Lord Li.

534
30:21.440 --> 30:22.070
Move.

535
30:22.070 --> 30:22.870
Wait a minute.

536
30:29.660 --> 30:34.860
[Breezes of Grace and Harmony]

537
30:39.510 --> 30:40.730
Alright, Jiuying.

538
30:43.560 --> 30:44.430
I know

539
30:45.350 --> 30:47.480
you still have concerns in your heart.

540
30:48.310 --> 30:49.400
But don't worry.

541
30:50.720 --> 30:51.910
We will give a proper burial

542
30:51.910 --> 30:52.800
to your mother.

543
30:54.270 --> 30:55.400
We will bury her

544
30:56.480 --> 30:58.740
in the place you carefully chose for her.

545
30:59.350 --> 31:00.160
Mother.

546
31:02.620 --> 31:03.270
Mother...

547
31:03.720 --> 31:05.880
Mother. Mother.

548
31:05.880 --> 31:07.200
Mother.

549
31:07.920 --> 31:09.830
Mother...

550
31:19.030 --> 31:20.790
Mother...

551
31:27.590 --> 31:29.000
Mother.

552
31:34.440 --> 31:36.270
Mother.

553
31:44.550 --> 31:46.720
Mother.

554
32:08.790 --> 32:09.790
Silly child.

555
32:10.570 --> 32:11.330
It's okay.

556
32:11.350 --> 32:12.190
Get up.

557
32:12.550 --> 32:13.640
Get up.

558
32:20.790 --> 32:22.040
It's okay. It's okay.

559
32:23.030 --> 32:23.830
Jiuying,

560
32:24.310 --> 32:25.200
listen to me.

561
32:27.140 --> 32:27.550
[Breezes of Grace and Harmony]

562
32:27.550 --> 32:28.350
This

563
32:30.350 --> 32:32.550
is the prison of the county government.

564
32:32.750 --> 32:33.950
You will temporarily

565
32:34.720 --> 32:36.030
stay here for now.

566
32:43.350 --> 32:44.290
Lord Situ.

567
32:44.290 --> 32:50.110
[Breezes of Grace and Harmony]

568
32:50.110 --> 32:51.440
Deep down, Jiu Ying

569
32:51.920 --> 32:53.240
is not a bad child.

570
32:53.720 --> 32:54.640
Please

571
32:55.480 --> 32:56.750
don't treat her harshly.

572
32:56.750 --> 32:56.790
[Integrity, Impartiality, Prudence, and Diligence]

573
32:56.790 --> 32:57.640
Lord Li.

574
32:58.000 --> 32:59.110
Please rest assured.

575
32:59.110 --> 33:01.370
I will have someone take good care of her.

576
33:09.030 --> 33:09.830
Go.

577
33:32.360 --> 33:35.480
[Integrity, Impartiality, Prudence, and Diligence]

578
33:35.480 --> 33:36.440
Lord Situ,

579
33:37.680 --> 33:38.940
there are 2 more things

580
33:39.110 --> 33:40.310
I need your help with.

581
33:41.070 --> 33:41.880
First,

582
33:43.160 --> 33:45.360
please send someone to keep an eye on the Gong Mansion.

583
33:45.360 --> 33:46.360
During this time,

584
33:46.700 --> 33:48.640
if anyone tries to flee,

585
33:49.010 --> 33:50.470
arrest them immediately.

586
33:52.450 --> 33:53.260
Second,

587
33:53.750 --> 33:54.830
go to the county

588
33:55.270 --> 33:56.870
and find some good swimmers,

589
33:56.920 --> 34:00.000
the kind who are good at diving, holding their breath,

590
34:00.110 --> 34:01.680
and salvaging underwater.

591
34:02.000 --> 34:03.060
I will do as you say.

592
34:08.280 --> 34:09.150
My Lords,

593
34:09.150 --> 34:10.510
I will take my leave now.

594
34:15.360 --> 34:16.230
An invitation?

595
34:19.760 --> 34:20.110
[Respectfully from the Ji Family]

596
34:20.110 --> 34:21.969
An invitation from the Ji family.

597
34:22.110 --> 34:23.330
This Ji Ada is quite bold.

598
34:23.330 --> 34:24.429
We haven't even settled the score with him

599
34:24.429 --> 34:25.380
for letting his dogs maul someone to death,

600
34:25.380 --> 34:26.989
yet he comes to us himself.

601
34:28.860 --> 34:29.900
Interesting.

602
34:30.429 --> 34:32.550
The person who delivered the invitation said

603
34:32.550 --> 34:33.980
it's to thank the Divine Constable Bureau

604
34:33.980 --> 34:35.120
for solving the case brilliantly

605
34:35.120 --> 34:36.030
and successfully catching

606
34:36.030 --> 34:37.469
Zhe Shan's murderer.

607
34:37.489 --> 34:40.000
He's holding some kind of appreciation banquet.

608
34:40.000 --> 34:40.280
[Invitation]

609
34:42.940 --> 34:44.850
He's certainly well-informed.

610
34:45.330 --> 34:47.590
The suspect was just locked up in prison,

611
34:47.659 --> 34:49.659
and he's already hosting a banquet.

612
34:49.679 --> 34:51.449
He doesn't even consider

613
34:51.480 --> 34:52.920
the blood on his hands.

614
34:53.110 --> 34:54.710
Then what are we waiting for?

615
34:54.710 --> 34:56.510
Every wrong has its cause, every debt has its debtor.

616
34:56.510 --> 34:58.710
Let's just go settle the score with him.

617
35:03.600 --> 35:04.780
[Invitation]

618
35:24.150 --> 35:25.150
Please, My Lords.

619
35:39.970 --> 35:41.960
You truly are Divine Constables of the Divine Constable Bureau.

620
35:41.960 --> 35:43.700
You've only been in Mingling for a few days,

621
35:43.700 --> 35:45.880
and you've already eliminated the green-haired demon

622
35:45.880 --> 35:46.830
and caught

623
35:46.850 --> 35:48.550
Zhe Shan's murderer.

624
35:48.920 --> 35:51.510
I am truly impressed.

625
35:51.550 --> 35:53.920
I have specially prepared some wine and dishes

626
35:53.920 --> 35:57.560
to celebrate your success and welcome you, My Lords.

627
35:58.360 --> 36:01.070
Come, My Lords, please have a seat.

628
36:16.670 --> 36:17.670
Lord Yan,

629
36:19.150 --> 36:20.680
what is the meaning of this?

630
36:24.920 --> 36:26.840
According to our dynasty's etiquette,

631
36:26.840 --> 36:28.550
royalty who break the law do not wear cangues.

632
36:28.550 --> 36:29.200
Since you are

633
36:29.200 --> 36:30.790
Princess Ding's cousin,

634
36:30.810 --> 36:32.600
whether you wear these shackles or not

635
36:32.600 --> 36:33.640
is up to you.

636
36:33.670 --> 36:35.860
But for the crimes you have committed,

637
36:35.920 --> 36:38.250
we will definitely pursue them to the end.

638
36:44.610 --> 36:46.130
So you are all here

639
36:46.160 --> 36:47.910
to condemn me.

640
36:48.320 --> 36:50.380
Then I would like to ask you, My Lords.

641
36:50.880 --> 36:52.920
What crime have I committed?

642
36:53.000 --> 36:55.190
Twelve years ago on Mount Fuyao,

643
36:56.320 --> 36:57.880
you had your dogs attack

644
36:57.920 --> 37:00.050
and kill someone, and buried the body.

645
37:05.560 --> 37:06.640
So Xia Jiuying

646
37:06.660 --> 37:09.120
still managed to piece her mother together.

647
37:09.800 --> 37:11.240
This fool.

648
37:11.720 --> 37:12.800
My Lords,

649
37:13.900 --> 37:15.220
you don't think

650
37:15.250 --> 37:17.060
you can convict me with just

651
37:17.080 --> 37:19.490
a bunch of rotten bones, do you?

652
37:19.520 --> 37:21.310
Your butler, Huang Bingshui,

653
37:21.360 --> 37:22.850
is currently at the county office,

654
37:22.850 --> 37:25.380
having a heart-to-heart talk with Lord Situ.

655
37:25.520 --> 37:26.160
Why not

656
37:26.190 --> 37:27.990
invite them to the Tingchao Boat

657
37:28.420 --> 37:31.130
and talk while we eat?

658
37:31.610 --> 37:33.450
Huang Bingshui...

659
37:38.510 --> 37:39.880
Huang Bingshui

660
37:39.900 --> 37:41.360
is an ungrateful traitor.

661
37:41.360 --> 37:43.290
You actually believe what he says?

662
37:47.400 --> 37:48.910
Back then,

663
37:50.150 --> 37:52.240
if he hadn't failed to hold on

664
37:52.270 --> 37:53.540
to that dog...

665
37:54.400 --> 37:56.660
Now he's turning around and accusing me.

666
37:56.730 --> 37:57.960
I think

667
37:59.110 --> 38:00.930
he's worse than a dog!

668
38:06.550 --> 38:07.780
My Lords.

669
38:08.360 --> 38:10.900
Wasn't she just a village woman?

670
38:11.150 --> 38:12.970
Is it worth making you all

671
38:13.000 --> 38:14.480
go to such great lengths

672
38:14.510 --> 38:15.970
and ruin your mood?

673
38:15.990 --> 38:16.870
Why don't we

674
38:17.760 --> 38:19.170
sit down and drink?

675
38:19.550 --> 38:21.700
You have no regard for the law whatsoever,

676
38:21.700 --> 38:22.190
do you?

677
38:22.190 --> 38:23.190
Lord Yan.

678
38:28.510 --> 38:30.370
We are here to investigate a case.

679
38:30.400 --> 38:32.260
Since we are here to investigate,

680
38:32.320 --> 38:33.800
we must follow the rules.

681
38:43.440 --> 38:44.510
However,

682
38:45.110 --> 38:46.880
what Mr. Ji just said

683
38:47.280 --> 38:48.510
is indeed true.

684
38:48.700 --> 38:50.160
Even a saint

685
38:50.400 --> 38:52.150
couldn't tolerate this.

686
38:53.190 --> 38:54.030
Is that so?

687
39:05.920 --> 39:07.660
-Li Si, you... -This slap

688
39:07.710 --> 39:09.530
is to vent some anger on behalf

689
39:09.710 --> 39:10.800
of Xia Jiuying and her mother.

690
39:10.800 --> 39:11.490
You...

691
39:21.760 --> 39:22.880
This slap

692
39:23.360 --> 39:25.000
is on behalf of the people

693
39:25.150 --> 39:26.480
of Mingling County,

694
39:26.650 --> 39:29.110
for your cruelty and for running a Hound Pit.

695
39:29.130 --> 39:30.360
Lord Li.

696
39:30.550 --> 39:31.440
Calm down.

697
39:31.670 --> 39:32.840
Didn't you just say

698
39:32.870 --> 39:35.670
that we must follow the rules when handling cases?

699
39:43.360 --> 39:44.470
Mr. Ji.

700
39:44.920 --> 39:46.320
Ms. Bai is right.

701
39:46.670 --> 39:47.720
Just now,

702
39:47.800 --> 39:49.320
I lost my temper.

703
39:49.400 --> 39:51.280
Please forgive me.

704
39:54.760 --> 39:57.030
Men!

705
40:02.510 --> 40:03.360
Mr. Ji.

706
40:06.110 --> 40:07.900
Capture them all!

707
40:08.360 --> 40:09.550
I don't care what bureau you're from.

708
40:09.550 --> 40:10.920
No authority can help you here.

709
40:10.920 --> 40:11.710
Today,

710
40:11.960 --> 40:13.820
none of you will leave here alive!

711
40:32.150 --> 40:33.250
What do you want?

712
40:33.270 --> 40:34.160
Where do you think you're going?

713
40:34.160 --> 40:34.910
Stay away!

714
40:34.930 --> 40:35.720
Stay away!

715
40:35.750 --> 40:37.230
Stay away! Stay away!

716
40:38.590 --> 40:39.500
-Stay away! -Stop!

717
40:39.500 --> 40:40.460
Stay away!

718
40:40.490 --> 40:42.320
The Divine Constable Bureau is killing people!

719
40:42.320 --> 40:45.280
The Divine Constable Bureau is killing...

720
41:00.910 --> 41:04.420
[Ji Mansion]

721
41:04.480 --> 41:05.280
Second Master!

722
41:05.280 --> 41:06.590
Bad news! Bad news!

723
41:07.510 --> 41:08.800
B-Bad news.

724
41:08.800 --> 41:09.710
Something terrible has happened.

725
41:09.710 --> 41:11.280
Why are you panicking?

726
41:11.760 --> 41:12.720
Master, he...

727
41:12.920 --> 41:14.320
Master fell into the sea!

728
41:16.670 --> 41:18.010
Has he been rescued?

729
41:18.190 --> 41:19.320
N-No.

730
41:20.360 --> 41:21.930
What are you waiting for?

731
41:22.150 --> 41:23.400
Hurry up and find him.

732
41:23.480 --> 41:24.710
Yes, yes.

733
41:29.510 --> 41:30.970
Two of you, move this away.

734
41:31.150 --> 41:32.140
Okay.

735
41:32.170 --> 41:33.360
Come, put it here.

736
41:35.710 --> 41:36.910
This side needs to be cleaned up too.

737
41:36.910 --> 41:37.720
Okay.

738
41:37.800 --> 41:38.810
Come, put it here.

739
42:09.510 --> 42:11.120
Your martial arts have improved.

740
42:11.120 --> 42:12.710
The rock crumbled like

741
42:12.710 --> 42:14.240
a block of salt in your hand.

742
42:14.590 --> 42:15.900
This is a block of salt.

743
42:23.710 --> 42:24.670
It really is.

744
42:27.150 --> 42:28.590
Huang Bingshui was right.

745
42:28.590 --> 42:30.690
The Hound Pit appeared to be an underground fighting ring,

746
42:30.690 --> 42:33.950
but it's actually a warehouse for hiding government salt.

747
42:35.510 --> 42:36.710
So

748
42:36.880 --> 42:38.190
this government salt

749
42:38.280 --> 42:40.320
was usually right under our feet.

750
42:41.480 --> 42:43.360
But making so much salt

751
42:43.800 --> 42:44.710
must have required

752
42:44.710 --> 42:46.230
a massive salt pan.

753
42:46.400 --> 42:48.190
Did no one find out?

754
42:49.550 --> 42:50.630
This salt

755
42:50.710 --> 42:53.360
may not have been made by the Ji family themselves.

756
42:53.360 --> 42:54.280
Don't forget

757
42:54.590 --> 42:56.000
what the Gong family

758
42:56.320 --> 42:57.720
of Mingling County does.

759
42:58.360 --> 43:00.070
Transporting government salt.

760
43:00.070 --> 43:01.510
They're embezzling imperial property.

761
43:01.510 --> 43:03.080
What Gong Le told us that day

762
43:03.100 --> 43:04.690
about the Gong family selling government salt

763
43:04.690 --> 43:06.330
seems to be true now.

764
43:07.880 --> 43:09.600
But aren't the Gong family and the Ji family

765
43:09.600 --> 43:11.540
sworn enemies?

766
43:12.110 --> 43:13.880
How could they collude?

767
43:14.180 --> 43:15.100
My Lords.

768
43:17.880 --> 43:18.800
My Lords.

769
43:18.920 --> 43:20.230
Have you found Ji Ada?

770
43:20.360 --> 43:21.230
Not yet.

771
43:21.360 --> 43:22.600
These past few days, our men

772
43:22.600 --> 43:24.250
have searched all the nearby beaches

773
43:24.250 --> 43:26.050
and haven't found Ji Ada's body.

774
43:26.360 --> 43:27.960
Lord Situ asked me to come and ask

775
43:27.960 --> 43:30.570
if we should keep searching.
